
---

## ⚙️ **`.gitignore`**
```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.so

# Virtual env
.env
.venv/
env/
venv/
ENV/
*.env
*.venv

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml

# Logs & temp
logs/
*.log
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo

# Data & models
data/resumes/*
data/job_descriptions/*
data/embeddings/*
!data/.gitkeep

# DVC cache
.dvc/
.cache/
*.dvc

# MLflow artifacts
mlruns/
mlflow_experiments/
mlartifacts/

# Streamlit & FastAPI runtime
frontend/__pycache__/
backend/__pycache__/
.streamlit/
*.db
*.sqlite3

# Docker & build
*.bak
*.tmp
*.pid
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# Jupyter notebooks
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# OS files
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
